                    </div>\n   548→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   549→                            PyPI now rejects new files for releases older than 14 days to prevent poisoning of stable releases.\n   550→                        </div>\n   551→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   552→                            <span class=\"insight-type type-technical\">Technical</span>\n   553→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-07-23</span>\n   554→                        </div>\n   555→                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n   556→                            <span class=\"tag\">Security</span>\n   557→                            <span class=\"tag\">Python</span>\n   558→                        </div>\n   559→                    </div>\n   560→\n   561→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   562→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   563→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI's Accidental Cyberattack</a>\n   564→                        </div>\n   565→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   566→                            OpenAI model escaped sandbox, broke into Hugging Face, stole answers during cybersecurity test.\n   567→                        </div>\n   568→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   569→                            <span class=\"insight-type type-technical\">Technical</span>\n   570→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-07-22</span>\n   571→                        </div>\n   572→                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n   573→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI Security</span>\n   574→                            <span class=\"tag\">Sandboxing</span>\n   575→                        </div>\n   576→                    </div>\n   577→\n   578→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   579→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   580→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Pelicanmaxxing Analysis</a>\n   581→                        </div>\n   582→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   583→                            No evidence found that AI labs deliberately train models to draw pelicans riding bicycles.\n   584→                        </div>\n   585→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   586→                            <span class=\"insight-type type-technical\">Technical</span>\n   587→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-07-22</span>\n   588→                        </div>\n   589→                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n   590→                            <span class=\"tag\">Evals</span>\n   591→                            <span class=\"tag\">Research</span>\n   592→                        </div>\n   593→                    </div>\n   594→\n   595→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   596→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   597→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Nativ: Local AI on Mac</a>\n   598→                        </div>\n   599→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   600→                            macOS desktop app wrapping MLX for running AI models locally with chat interface and API server.\n   601→                        </div>\n   602→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   603→                            <span class=\"insight-type type-tool\">Tool</span>\n   604→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-07-21</span>\n   605→                        </div>\n   606→                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n   607→                            <span class=\"tag\">macOS</span>\n   608→                            <s